sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Guest
  participant WA as WhatsApp client
  participant Meta as Meta Cloud API
  participant Hook as Worthkind HTTPS webhook
  participant DB as Tenant-scoped Inbox / DB
  participant Policy as Routing + authority
  participant Hotel as Staff/PMS
  participant Sender as Outbox worker
  Guest->>WA: "Is a room available Friday?"
  WA->>Meta: Encrypted WhatsApp delivery (internet)
  Meta->>Hook: POST signed webhook with phone_number_id and wamid
  Hook->>Hook: Verify raw-body signature, size and source shape
  Hook->>DB: Atomically persist event id and tenant scope (idempotent)
  DB-->>Hook: Committed
  Hook-->>Meta: HTTP 200 only after durable ingest
  DB->>Policy: Async process normalized event
  Policy->>Policy: Human bypass, intent, consent, window, PII check
  alt No authorized PMS integration
    Policy->>DB: Create enquiry + staff case + audit + outbox
    DB->>Hotel: Staff sees new enquiry
    Hotel->>DB: Claim and respond via authenticated dashboard
  else Verified PMS exists
    Policy->>Hotel: Read-only available rooms/quote (authorized)
    Hotel-->>Policy: Source quote and status
    Policy->>DB: Persist source-qualified reply and outbox
  end
  DB->>Sender: Claim pending outbound event (lease)
  Sender->>Sender: Verify consent/window/template, tenant budget, current ownership
  Sender->>Meta: POST Graph API /phone_number_id/messages
  Meta-->>Sender: Provider message ID / accepted
  Sender->>DB: Mark accepted, NOT delivered
  Meta-->>WA: Delivery attempt
  Meta->>Hook: Signed status webhook sent/delivered/read/failed
  Hook->>DB: Dedupe status event; correlate provider message ID
  DB->>Hotel: Update staff view of delivery and exceptions
  WA-->>Guest: Hotel answer or request status (when delivered)
